{"5041530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Put Your Toys Away Together!", "steam_appid": 5041530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5063770], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIDY THE TOY STORE – TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/9528119a58920e7ae34e05a0543ccfd0.poster.avif?t=1788353379\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/9528119a58920e7ae34e05a0543ccfd0.webm?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/9528119a58920e7ae34e05a0543ccfd0.mp4?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entire toy store has been left in a total mess, and it's your job to set it right. Find the perfect home for every doll, dinosaur and toy car, turning the mess into a calm, colorful little world. Play solo at your own pace, or team up with up to 4 friends and tidy side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY TOY IN ITS PLACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/18bd42d76ae1df550023195adc615810.poster.avif?t=1788353379\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/18bd42d76ae1df550023195adc615810.webm?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/18bd42d76ae1df550023195adc615810.mp4?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check a shelf, find the scattered toys that belong there, and slot each one into place as the display fills up piece by piece. Every correct placement lands with a satisfying pop of color and sound – and finishing a whole shelf pays off even bigger. Simple to pick up, and easy to lose hours in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WATCH THE STORE COME ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/6557d36124f825f2d4f752b7faed98fb.poster.avif?t=1788353379\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/6557d36124f825f2d4f752b7faed98fb.webm?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/6557d36124f825f2d4f752b7faed98fb.mp4?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the childhood dream of a toy store all to yourself, with hundreds of unique toys and 20,000 to sort out on a single level. The store comes alive as you go: fire up toy trains, build dollhouses, and bring whole dioramas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO RUSH, NO PRESSURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/eb063958ce7919145f24302e0f38ecbc.poster.avif?t=1788353379\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/eb063958ce7919145f24302e0f38ecbc.webm?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/eb063958ce7919145f24302e0f38ecbc.mp4?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Few things feel as good as watching a mess fall into perfect order – every toy that clicks into place scratches an itch you didn't know you had. Sort at your own rhythm, lose yourself in the details, and let the whole store settle into place.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIDY THE TOY STORE – TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/9528119a58920e7ae34e05a0543ccfd0.poster.avif?t=1788353379\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/9528119a58920e7ae34e05a0543ccfd0.webm?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/9528119a58920e7ae34e05a0543ccfd0.mp4?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entire toy store has been left in a total mess, and it's your job to set it right. Find the perfect home for every doll, dinosaur and toy car, turning the mess into a calm, colorful little world. Play solo at your own pace, or team up with up to 4 friends and tidy side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY TOY IN ITS PLACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/18bd42d76ae1df550023195adc615810.poster.avif?t=1788353379\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/18bd42d76ae1df550023195adc615810.webm?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/18bd42d76ae1df550023195adc615810.mp4?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check a shelf, find the scattered toys that belong there, and slot each one into place as the display fills up piece by piece. Every correct placement lands with a satisfying pop of color and sound – and finishing a whole shelf pays off even bigger. Simple to pick up, and easy to lose hours in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WATCH THE STORE COME ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/6557d36124f825f2d4f752b7faed98fb.poster.avif?t=1788353379\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/6557d36124f825f2d4f752b7faed98fb.webm?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/6557d36124f825f2d4f752b7faed98fb.mp4?t=1788353379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the childhood dream of a toy store all to yourself, with hundreds of unique toys and 20,000 to sort out on a single level. The store comes alive as you go: fire up toy trains, build dollhouses, and bring whole dioramas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO RUSH, NO PRESSURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/eb063958ce7919145f24302e0f38ecbc.poster.avif?t=1788353379\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5041530/extras/eb063